<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Kiss it Goodbye</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Hannah Montana</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Hannah Montana Forever</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">4SdR86EedszvIrLBTMKi3b</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">13 Contributors</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Kiss It Goodbye Lyrics</p><p ttm:agent="v1">“Kiss It Goodbye” was originally sung by Ewa Farna under the name “"Kdo dá víc.”</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Intro]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Kiss it goodbye</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Kiss it goodbye (Kiss it goodbye)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 1]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Whatcha waiting for, an opportunity to knock?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">C'mon, it's at your door</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You're crazy if you leave it locked</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You know you got to let it in, and finally I know it too</p><p ttm:agent="v1">The question's what it's always been</p><p ttm:agent="v1">So, what are you gonna do?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Pre-Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Blow another chance?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">No, I understand</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Yo, if you're coming, hello</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Kiss it goodbye</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Your fear is holding you back</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Kiss it goodbye</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Your little panic attack</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Kiss it goodbye</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I, I did it, and it's OMG</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'm a different girl</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Kiss it goodbye</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Kiss it goodbye[Verse 2]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You procrastinate the world, it's gonna pass you by</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Already running late, instead of running, better fly</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You crashed into the ground, and hard</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You pick yourself up and laugh (Ha)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You keep on shooting for the stars</p><p ttm:agent="v1">What other choice do you have?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Pre-Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Blow another chance?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">No, I understand</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Yo, if you're coming, hello</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Kiss it goodbye</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Your fear is holding you back</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Kiss it goodbye</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Your little panic attack</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Kiss it goodbye</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I, I did it, and it's OMG</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'm a different girl</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Kiss it goodbye</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Kiss it goodbye (Kiss it goodbye)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Kiss it goodbye (Ha)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Kiss it goodbye[Bridge]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Kiss, kiss, kiss it all goodbye-bye (Goodbye)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Kiss, kiss, kiss it all goodbye-bye</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Kiss, kiss, kiss it all goodbye-bye</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Kiss, kiss, kiss it all goodbye</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Interlude]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Kiss</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Kiss it all goodbye (Goodbye)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Kiss it goodbye</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Your fear is holding you back</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Kiss it goodbye</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Your little panic attack (yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Kiss it goodbye</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I, I did it, and it's OMG (Did it, OMG)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'm a different girl</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Kiss it all goodbye</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Kiss it all goodbye</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Mm, kiss it goodbye</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Kiss it all goodbye</p></div></body></tt>